<title>USA: Metropolitan Realty Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Metropolitan Realty Corp Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended September 30</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Total revenue				 $982,329	$973,527</p>
<p> Net investment income			872,881     (183,720)</p>
<p> Net investment income per share	     0.19	  (0.04)</p>
